in="00:12.480" end="00:12.780">what </span><span begin="00:12.780" end="00:13.170">they </span><span begin="00:13.170" end="00:14.010">say </span><span begin="00:14.010" end="00:14.370">keep </span><span begin="00:14.370" end="00:14.670">you </span><span begin="00:14.670" end="00:14.940">up </span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:15.330">at </span><span begin="00:15.330" end="00:15.840">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.900" end="00:17.910"><span begin="00:15.900" end="00:16.260">And </span><span begin="00:16.260" end="00:16.470">if </span><span begin="00:16.470" end="00:16.650">they </span><span begin="00:16.650" end="00:16.890">give </span><span begin="00:16.890" end="00:17.340">you </span><span begin="00:17.340" end="00:17.400">shh</span><span begin="00:17.400" end="00:17.570">.</span><span begin="00:17.570" end="00:17.740">.</span><span begin="00:17.740" end="00:17.910">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.910" end="00:20.280"><span begin="00:17.910" end="00:18.270">Then </span><span begin="00:18.270" end="00:18.450">they </span><span begin="00:18.450" end="00:18.720">can </span><span begin="00:18.720" end="00:19.110">walk </span><span begin="00:19.110" end="00:19.530">on </span><span begin="00:19.530" end="00:20.280">by</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.280" end="00:23.580"><span begin="00:20.280" end="00:20.730">My </span><span begin="00:20.730" end="00:21.510">feet</span><span begin="00:21.510" end="00:21.540">, </span><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:21.990">feet </span><span begin="00:21.990" end="00:22.410">can't </span><span begin="00:22.410" end="00:22.710">touch </span><span begin="00:22.710" end="00:22.890">the </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.580">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.760" end="00:25.620"><span begin="00:23.760" end="00:23.970">And </span><span begin="00:23.970" end="00:24.060">I </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.510">can't </span><span begin="00:24.510" end="00:24.870">hear </span><s